Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 10:06:54 +0800
Subject: ARM: dts: hisilicon: describe the cv200 GPIO, I2C and SSP controllers

The pin controllers and the two slow buses have no description.
The eighteen PL061 banks each have a wired interrupt and answer their ID
header, the six I2C adapters are the hix5hd2 IP gated by CRG27, and the
two SSPs are PL022 gated by CRG28 with one clock per port.
Describe all three controllers so the in-tree drivers bind.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 377 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)


